### SecureHerAI Admin API Tests
### These endpoints use a fixed API key instead of JWT authentication
### Header: X-Admin-Key: SECUREHER_ADMIN_KEY_2026

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@adminKey = SECUREHER_ADMIN_KEY_2026

### ========================================
### USER MANAGEMENT ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### 1. Get All Users
### Returns list of all users with their details
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### 2. Get User Statistics
### Returns counts and breakdowns of users
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### 3. Get User by ID
### Replace {userId} with actual UUID
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/b2139a31-1857-4429-82ab-7ba1af861f1d
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### 4. Get User by Email
### URL encode the email if it contains special characters
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/email/ansextra001@gmail.com
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### ========================================
### DELETE USER ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### 5. Delete User by ID
### Replace {userId} with actual UUID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/b2139a31-1857-4429-82ab-7ba1af861f1d
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### 6. Delete User by Email
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/email/ansextra001@gmail.com
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### 7. Delete ALL Users - DANGER!
### Requires confirmation parameter for safety
### This will permanently delete ALL users from the database!
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/all?confirm=DELETE_ALL_USERS
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### 7b. Delete All Users - Without confirmation (will fail safely)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/all
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### ========================================
### ERROR CASES (For testing)
### ========================================

### 8. Invalid Admin Key (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
X-Admin-Key: wrong_key

### 9. Missing Admin Key (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users

### 10. Invalid User ID format (should return 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/invalid-uuid
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### 11. Non-existent User (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### ========================================
### PRODUCTION ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

@prodUrl = https://www.secureherai.me/api

### 12. Get All Users (Production)
GET {{prodUrl}}/admin/users
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### 13. Get User Stats (Production)
GET {{prodUrl}}/admin/stats
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### 14. Get User by Email (Production)
GET {{prodUrl}}/admin/users/email/a.n.swapnil2003@gmail.com
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
